# Flowchart – Case Study 7

```mermaid
flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Input registration IDs and payments/]
 B --> C[Normalize registration ID]
 C --> D{ID already registered?}
 D -- Yes --> E[Mark duplicate; do not count again]
 D -- No --> F[Add ID and count first payment]
 E --> G{More registrations?}
 F --> G
 G -- Yes --> B
 G -- No --> H[/Input sponsorship and expenses/]
 H --> I[Calculate revenue and final balance]
 I --> J{Balance positive?}
 J -- Yes --> K[Report SURPLUS]
 J -- No --> L[Report deficit or break-even]
 K --> M[Display financial audit]
 L --> M
 M --> N([Stop])
```
